<#-- The body of a quote's mail and of its reminder (mantle.order.SalesQuoteIssueServices build#QuoteMessage and
     build#QuoteReminderMessage): the organization's text, rendered locked with an explicit map (F70) and passed in as textHtml, and
     the sender's note. The issued PDF is attached; an accepted delivery is not the customer's acceptance. -->
<div style="font:11pt Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif">
<#if note><p><#list String(note).split('\n') as noteLine>${noteLine}<br></#list></p></#if>
${raw(textHtml)}
</div>
